5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should be objective. I want to know about the state of the car at handover and the mechanic's remarks at the last service.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I'm curious about the hours of use recorded in the diary and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. To find true balance, I wish to see last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I don't care about the money as much as the fighting. I'll check what two other car-sharing households said and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know the real costs! I'll look into last year's fuel receipts and the weeks of heavy use over the year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, checking figures sounds like a nightmare. Let's hope you enjoy the paperwork!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a small price to pay for clarity and peace of mind, May.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop joking. We need to figure out why we're all acting so weird lately, not just who drove more.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, that's why we need the numbers! If we know the truth, we can stop fighting and be friends again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, you're so optimistic. I bet the numbers will just give us more to argue about.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,Conflict is merely a bridge to a deeper understanding. Let us cross it with grace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Grace doesn't fix a broken mood. I'm sticking to my plan to see how others handled this.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not worried! Once we see the fuel receipts, everything will be clear.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
