35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The car is often left in a poor state, and short trips are causing more wear than we realize.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh, it's even worse than I thought. We spend more time fighting over the schedule than actually driving!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I have seen that the fixed costs are quite high, and that our attempts to audit each other only breed resentment.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,I found out that the real problem isn't the money. It's the constant asking for favors and the feeling of being owed.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, the fuel costs are totally uneven! Some of us are paying way more than others without even knowing it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, the cost is one thing, but the condition of the car is what makes it stressful to use.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, exactly! The ""favor"" economy is exhausting. I'm tired of the mental gymnastics every single evening.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"We must remember that a shared burden is lighter, but only if the burden is shared with a joyful heart.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, stop with the poetry. We need a system where we don't have to beg each other for a turn.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, I agree, but we can't fix the car if we don't have a fair way to pay for the gas first!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if the car is broken or empty, the payment system doesn't matter because I can't even leave the house.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're both so dramatic. Why don't we just stop the constant negotiating? It's a waste of my time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,Perhaps we should look beyond the numbers and consider a system that values the harmony of the group over the precision of the cent.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I agree. If we just set a hard rule, we don't have to ask for favors. That's what kills the mood.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,But we can't just ignore the fuel! Some people are being totally ripped off. That's not fair to our friends.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"@Kenji, ""fair"" is subjective. What's fair to you is a spreadsheet; what's fair to me is not spending an hour on the phone every night.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us seek a middle path. One that acknowledges the cost but protects the spirit of our friendship.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm tired of the ""middle path."" Let's just pick a system that stops the bickering.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I just want us to be honest about the money so we can move on!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
