60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A is the most stable. I know exactly when the car is available and who is responsible for its state.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is a dream! No more negotiating, no more ""can I use it?"" texts. Just my day, my car.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option A provides a quiet structure. It removes the need for the auditing that we know causes such friction among us.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option A is the only one that stops the ""favor"" cycle. If it's my day, I don't have to ask anyone for anything.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I like Option C because it's the most honest about the money. We pay for what we actually use!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, Option C requires constant recording and checking. That's exactly what leads to the disputes we're trying to avoid.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, please don't make us do more math. I'm voting for A just to save my sanity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, precision can sometimes be the enemy of peace. A fixed share is a simpler way to live.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, you're still obsessed with the fuel. Look at the bigger picture. We're stopping being friends because of this car.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,But Option A is unfair if I drive ten miles and someone else drives a hundred! That's not how friends treat each other.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, the ""unfairness"" of a few miles is better than the ""unfairness"" of finding the car empty on a Tuesday morning.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,Exactly! I'd rather pay a bit more than spend my evenings as a car-sharing secretary.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,"When we stop counting every grain of sand, we can finally enjoy the beach. Option A is the path to tranquility.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, just give it up. Everyone else wants the stress to stop. Let's just go with A and be done with it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I guess... if everyone else really hates the recording part, I can't force them. I just wanted it to be right.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
